+    "Whitening distinguishes the low-level queries from the parameter callback.\n",
+    "For raw factor residuals $e$ and fixed whitening matrix $W$, the whitened\n",
+    "factor residuals are $r=We$. A `pullback` result $\\bar r$ becomes\n",
