+    "## Routes\n",
+    "\n",
+    "Slippery zones of 2 to 4 steps start with probability 0.12 at each step, so about 30% of the steps\n",
+    "are slippery. On a slippery step the robot covers only 30 to 70% of the commanded 1 m."
