+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "## One route up close\n",
+    "\n",
+    "The trajectories show where the error comes from. Dead reckoning trusts every odometry step, so it\n",
+    "overshoots each slippery stretch. The graph pulls the trajectory back toward the GPS fixes, and the mode\n",
+    "evidence decides which steps absorb the correction."
+   ]
+  },
