+   "source": [
+    "The mode probabilities involved are of two kinds. The evidence is the unary factor\n",
+    "$P(m_k)$ that each source puts on a step. The posterior combines it with the geometry: given the\n",
+    "estimated poses, the mode of step $k$ is coupled only to its own odometry factor and evidence, so\n",
+    "`discretePosterior` on a graph with just those two factors gives $P(m_k \\mid x_{k-1}, x_k)$."
+   ]
+  },
